# Used by BuildKit for builds with -f backend/Dockerfile (the context is the repository
# root, so backend/.dockerignore doesn't apply). Keeps local environments, caches, build
# output and tests out of the context; none of them belong in an image.
**/.env
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/build
**/tests
**/*.md
.git
